## Executive Summary (30-Second Pitch)

**What we sell:** Software that makes AI do complex work the right way, every time.

**The problem:** AI tools are powerful but inconsistent. They improvise, skip steps, and produce unpredictable results. Companies can't trust AI with critical workflows.

**Our solution:** Isagawa is an "execution engine" — software that encodes expert knowledge into rules that AI must follow. No improvisation. No skipped steps. Consistent, correct outcomes.

**Think of it as:** Autopilot for AI. Not suggestions. Not recommendations. Actual enforcement.

