## Who We Sell To

### Primary Target: QA Teams (Quality Assurance / Software Testing)

**Why QA first:**
- Clear, measurable outcomes (tests pass or fail)
- High pain point (test automation is tedious, error-prone)
- Technical buyers who understand the value immediately
- Strong word-of-mouth in developer communities

**The persona:**
- QA Engineers, QA Leads, SDETs (Software Development Engineers in Test)
- Work at mid-size to enterprise companies
- Frustrated with flaky tests, inconsistent automation
- Want to adopt AI but worried about quality

**Their pain:**
- "AI-generated tests don't follow our patterns"
- "Every developer writes tests differently"
- "We spend more time fixing AI output than writing it ourselves"

**Our promise:**
- "AI that writes tests your way, every time"
- "Your standards, enforced automatically"

### Secondary Target: Developers (Lead Generation)

**Why developers:**
- Large market, drives awareness
- Easy entry point (free/freemium tier)
- Converts to QA team sales when they recommend to their org

